### Configuration

Enable trend tracking in `.copilot-space/workflow.yaml`:

```yaml
trends:
  enabled: true
  database_path: "audit_artifacts/trends.db"
  auto_store: true
  retention:
    max_runs: 1000
    max_age_days: 365
  regression_detection:
    enabled: true
    threshold: 0.02
    lookback_runs: 5
    fail_on_high_severity: true
```

